    /* --- ON --- */
    'on.heading':      'Letter of Motivation',
    'on.salutation':   'Dear ON Team',
    'on.p1':           'ON ignites the human spirit through movement. My work begins where a brand stops talking and starts making an impact.',
    'on.p2':           'I don\'t just bring experience &ndash; I also bring a well-founded perspective on ON as a brand. In my bachelor\'s thesis, I analysed the brand activism communication strategies of ON, Nike and Adidas, and came to understand what sets ON apart: authenticity that lives in the DNA, not stuck on the campaign surface.',
    'on.p3':           'What draws me to ON is precisely this ambition. <em>Ignite the human spirit through movement</em> doesn\'t exhaust itself in a trade show tent. It demands formats that trigger something, experiences that reach beyond the moment and truly move people. That\'s the standard I hold my own work to.',
    'on.p4':           'At Tit-Pit, I led brand experiences for brands like Migros across 10+ music festivals throughout Switzerland &ndash; from strategic concept and quoting through client alignment to on-site execution. In parallel, I managed content marketing and social media around these formats, because for me an event only truly works when it lives on beyond the moment and strengthens the brand.',
    'on.p5':           'This combination of campaign management, stakeholder ownership and operational precision is my sweet spot &ndash; and a perfect match for what ON does in the brand experience space.',
    'on.p6':           'I bring ownership, pace and a solutions-oriented mindset, and I believe the strongest experiences are created when genuine enthusiasm meets strategic thinking.',
    'on.closing':      'Keep moving,<br>Shayna Jucker',
