    'zw.m1-label':      'Developing the brand',
    'zw.m1-text':       'Brand management and brand experience daily for the past year and a half &ndash; designing brand appearances and keeping them consistent across a whole season.',
    'zw.m2-label':      'Corporate identity across all channels',
    'zw.m2-text':       'At TIT-PIT I am responsible for our own brand presence across every touchpoint. My work sample shows how I anchor CI systematically instead of policing it.',
    'zw.m3-label':      'Print, digital and POS',
    'zw.m3-text':       'From stand layout and signage through flyers and sales documents to social assets. Artwork and print-ready files included &ndash; that comes from five years of architectural drafting.',
    'zw.m4-label':      'Visual concepts for campaigns',
    'zw.m4-text':       'Concepts for Migros activations at more than ten festivals: idea, imagery, mechanics and delivery, each from first briefing to breakdown.',
    'zw.m5-label':      'Planning and running campaigns',
    'zw.m5-text':       'Campaign management with timeline, budget, suppliers and reporting. Post-event reports with KPIs for clients are standard.',
    'zw.m6-label':      'Content for social, newsletter, website',
    'zw.m6-text':       'Responsible for social media content and client communication at TIT-PIT. German and English both native, both written to publication standard.',
    'zw.m7-label':      'Every document produced independently',
    'zw.m7-text':       'Adobe Creative Cloud daily: InDesign, Illustrator, Photoshop, Premiere Pro, After Effects, Lightroom. Plus Figma, Canva and websites. I do not need an agency for a sales sheet.',
    'zw.m8-label':      'AI tools in the content process',
    'zw.m8-text':       'In daily use for drafts, variants and image preparation &ndash; with a clear line: the draft may come from the tool, the text that goes out is edited.',
    'zw.m9-label':      'Sales documents &amp; wine marketing',
    'zw.m9-text':       'Quotes, concepts and sales documents for clients such as Migros. How I build trade and retail material is exactly what the kit shows, margin calculator included.',
    'zw.m10-label':     'Supplier campaigns',
    'zw.m10-text':      'Running campaigns with external partners and their guidelines is agency routine: respect someone else&rsquo;s rules and still hold your own brand.',
    'zw.m11-label':     'Tastings, trade fairs, customer events',
    'zw.m11-text':      'Live communication is my degree specialisation and my job: more than ten major events a year, plus hosting and directing the Multimedia Award 2023 at Plaza Zurich.',
    'zw.m12-label':     'Projects, agencies, budget',
    'zw.m12-text':      'Project management since 2020, first in architecture, now in marketing. Budget responsibility, production coordination and agency and supplier steering from both sides of the briefing.',
    'zw.facts-label':   'Key facts &ndash; including the awkward ones',
    'zw.fact1':         'Available from November 2026',
    'zw.fact2':         'Based in Pf&auml;ffikon ZH &ndash; about 15 minutes to Volketswil, about 30 to Zurich-H&ouml;ngg',
    'zw.fact3':         'German and English native &ndash; I do not speak Italian',
    'zw.fact4':         'No professional experience in the wine and beverage trade, but experience with drinks activations and serving at public events',
    'zw.fact5':         'Qualified architectural draftswoman &ndash; five years of artwork and dimensional accuracy',
    'zw.fact6':         'BSc Multimedia Production FHGR, specialisation Live Communication, exchange semester in the Netherlands',
    'zw.fact7':         'Bachelor thesis: brand activism at ON, Nike and Adidas',
